	"_comment": "Vectors of _shared/lua/updater/list_cache.lua: which stored release-list copies a restart may send as a conditional request again. Replayed by the Linux and macOS Lua suites. valid is whether validate accepts the value; reason_contains is a fragment of the refusal.",
